---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import AgentDiagram from "../../components/AgentDiagram.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Agentic Manufacturing"
  description="ARMS investigates software agents that operate CAD, CAM, and CNC systems."
  current="/research/agentic-manufacturing/"
>
  <section class="section detail-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Research / Agentic Manufacturing</p>
    <h1>Software agents for the manufacturing workflow.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      ARMS investigates agents that operate and coordinate traditional
      manufacturing software and machines, with the goal of reducing reliance on
      manual interaction across CAD, CAM, and CNC.
    </p>
    <AgentDiagram />
  </section>
  <section class="section soft">
    <p class="eyebrow">The research direction</p>
    <h2>Connect the steps from design to manufacture.</h2>
    <div class="three">
      <div>
        <h3>Design Operator Agent</h3>
        <p>Working with CAD software and design inputs.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>CAM Operator Agent</h3>
        <p>Working with manufacturing planning software.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Machine Operator Agent</h3>
        <p>Working with CNC machine tools.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="note">
      These roles describe the research concept; they do not assert a
      demonstrated level of autonomy.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section reading-link">
    <span class="role">Publications</span>
    <a href="/publications/">Browse ARMS publications →</a>
  </section>
  <section class="section closing">
    <h2>Interested in Agentic Manufacturing?</h2>
    <p>
      We welcome student inquiries and discussions of related industrial
      research challenges.
    </p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/open-positions/">
        Student inquiry information →
      </a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="mailto:msoshi@ucdavis.edu">
        Discuss collaboration
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
